<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.5000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.5000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.5000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday after 75.5600 on Monday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     June 3		  June 2</p>
<p> High			     75.7000		 75.7700</p>
<p> Low				75.3000		 75.4000</p>
<p> Open			     75.7000		 75.7700</p>
<p> Close			    75.5000		 75.5600</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    4.280		   0.625</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
